# Local secrets, read by scripts/version_flags.py and never committed.
#
# This holds the fleet API key so builds pick it up without an environment
# variable being set by hand every time. It is the one file in this project that
# must never reach git: a secret in a commit is in every clone and every copy of
# the history from that moment, and rotating the key does not remove it.
#
# The .example file next to it IS committed - it is the documentation.
secrets.local.ini
